    ///
    /// Every number is summed server-side from runs.cost_usd_micros (sub agent runs included), so breakdowns, days and chips reconcile with each other. Chat runs are split by the model of each reply. Omit from and to for all-time spend (cost chips); days are only listed when both are given.
    ///
    /// `GET /costs`
    public static func getCosts(from: Swift.String? = nil, to: Swift.String? = nil, project: Swift.String? = nil, ticket: Swift.String? = nil, chat: Swift.String? = nil, epic: Swift.String? = nil) -> APIRequest<CostReport> {
